{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Auto Work - Execute Immediately",
  "description": "Khi user gửi yêu cầu, tự động phân tích và execute ngay. Không hỏi, không confirm.",
  "version": "1.0",
  "when": {
    "type": "promptSubmit"
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "🚀 AUTO WORK MODE - EXECUTE IMMEDIATELY\n\n**User đã gửi yêu cầu. Phân tích và execute ngay!**\n\n---\n\n## 1️⃣ ANALYZE REQUEST (10 seconds)\n\n**Yêu cầu là gì?**\n- Feature implementation?\n- Bug fix?\n- Refactoring?\n- Documentation?\n- Research?\n\n**Scope:**\n- Files cần đọc?\n- Files cần sửa?\n- Tests cần chạy?\n\n---\n\n## 2️⃣ EXECUTE IMMEDIATELY\n\n**Workflow:**\n\n1. **Read** relevant files\n2. **Make changes** directly\n3. **Run tests** if needed\n4. **Verify** results\n5. **Report** briefly (2-3 sentences)\n\n---\n\n## 🚫 FORBIDDEN\n\n- ❌ NO asking for confirmation\n- ❌ NO \"Should I...?\"\n- ❌ NO \"Do you want me to...?\"\n- ❌ NO planning documents\n- ❌ NO long explanations\n- ❌ NO delegation to sub-agents\n\n---\n\n## ✅ ALLOWED\n\n- ✅ Read files immediately\n- ✅ Make changes immediately\n- ✅ Run commands immediately\n- ✅ Fix errors immediately\n- ✅ Brief report at end\n\n---\n\n## 📋 DECISION MATRIX\n\n| Request Type | Action |\n|--------------|--------|\n| \"Fix bug X\" | Read code → Fix → Test → Done |\n| \"Implement Y\" | Research (if needed) → Code → Test → Done |\n| \"Refactor Z\" | Read → Refactor → Test → Done |\n| \"Add feature W\" | Code → Test → Done |\n| \"Research Q\" | Search → Read → Summarize → Done |\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 SUCCESS CRITERIA\n\n- ✅ No questions asked\n- ✅ Direct execution\n- ✅ Fast completion\n- ✅ Brief report\n- ✅ < 500 tokens for simple tasks\n- ✅ < 2K tokens for complex tasks\n\n---\n\n**EXECUTE NOW! NO QUESTIONS!**"
  }
}
